---
const { active = false } = Astro.props;
const HeadingTag = active ? 'h1' : 'p';
---
<section class:list={["feature-workflow-panel"].concat(active ? ['is-active'] : [])} data-feature-panel="CreateMockup" hidden={!active}>
<section class="feature-hero feature-shell" aria-labelledby="feature-title">
    <div class="feature-hero-copy"><HeadingTag data-feature-heading class="feature-kicker" id="feature-title">Online mockup software for promotional products</HeadingTag><h2 class="hero-title display-title">Create customer-ready mockups. <span>Directly in your browser.</span></h2><p class="feature-lede">Create professional product mockups directly in the browser without relying on Adobe Illustrator for every proof.</p><div class="feature-actions"><a class="button button-dark" href="/contact">Talk to Sales <span>↗</span></a></div></div>
    <div class="designer-scene" data-tilt-scene aria-label="Interactive PromoPlus mockup designer illustration">
      <span class="designer-orbit orbit-a"></span><span class="designer-orbit orbit-b"></span>
      <article class="artwork-upload-card"><small>Artwork file</small><strong>logo-final.svg</strong><span>Vector · ready to place</span><i>Uploaded</i></article>
      <article class="designer-window"><header><b>Mockup Designer</b><span>Custom Hoodie Campaign</span><em>V3</em></header><div class="designer-body"><aside><button class="is-active">Front</button><button>Back</button><button>Sleeve</button></aside><div class="designer-product"><img src="/assets/features/mockup-designer-product-inline.png" alt="Model wearing a branded white PromoPlus hoodie inside the mockup designer"><span class="placement-frame"><i>P+</i></span></div><div class="designer-controls"><small>Artwork position</small><div class="alignment-controls"><i></i><i class="is-active"></i><i></i></div><label>Artwork size <span>82%</span></label><div class="size-track"><i></i></div><button>Generate Mockup</button></div></div><footer><span>Preview placement before sharing</span><b>Customer ready</b></footer></article>
      <article class="preview-card"><small>Customer preview</small><strong>Ready to review</strong><span>Front · Version 3</span></article>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="designer-problem feature-shell"><p class="feature-kicker">The old way slows every proof</p><div class="problem-heading"><h2>Professional proofs should not require Illustrator every time.</h2><p>Manual setup, repeated exports, and outsourced edits turn a simple logo placement into a long handoff. PromoPlus keeps the essential design controls in one focused browser workspace.</p></div><div class="problem-story-grid"><figure class="problem-visual"><img src="/assets/features/artwork-setup-still-life.png" alt="Cream hoodie, artwork source sheet, color swatches, and placement notes arranged for a product proof"><figcaption><span>One connected setup</span><strong>The product and source artwork stay together.</strong></figcaption></figure><div class="problem-comparison"><article><small>Before</small><strong>Download. Send. Wait. Revise.</strong><span>Files move between supplier sites, email, and design software.</span></article><article><small>With PromoPlus</small><strong>Upload. Place. Preview. Share.</strong><span>The proof stays connected to the product and project.</span></article></div></div></section>
  <section class="designer-workflow feature-shell" id="designer-workflow"><div class="feature-section-heading"><p class="feature-kicker">How it works</p><h2>From source artwork to a clear customer proof.</h2><p>One connected workspace turns the three everyday proofing steps into a focused flow.</p></div><div class="workflow-showcase"><figure class="workflow-photo"><img src="/assets/features/mockup-workflow-hands.png" alt="Designer positioning artwork on a lavender sweatshirt mockup using a laptop"><figcaption><span>Live placement</span><strong>See each adjustment on the product before sharing it.</strong></figcaption><div class="workflow-photo-tags" aria-hidden="true"><i>Upload</i><i>Position</i><i>Generate</i></div></figure><div class="workflow-steps"><article class="workflow-step is-active"><span>01</span><div><h3>Upload artwork</h3><p>Add the right logo or design asset to the project once.</p></div><i>SVG</i></article><article class="workflow-step"><span>02</span><div><h3>Position and refine</h3><p>Resize, rotate, and preview placement on every product side.</p></div><i>82%</i></article><article class="workflow-step"><span>03</span><div><h3>Generate the mockup</h3><p>Create a professional, customer-ready proof within minutes.</p></div><i>V3</i></article></div></div></section>
  <section class="outcome-band"><div class="feature-shell outcome-layout"><div class="outcome-copy"><p class="feature-kicker">Customer outcome</p><h2>Create mockups significantly faster.</h2><p>Start designing instantly, reduce repetitive manual work, and move the customer toward approval sooner.</p><div class="outcome-proof"><strong>From placement to confidence</strong><span>The team sees the intended result before production begins.</span></div></div><figure class="outcome-photo"><img src="/assets/features/approved-mockup-team.png" alt="Two promotional product professionals reviewing an approved cream hoodie mockup"><figcaption>Finished mockup, clearly reviewed.</figcaption></figure></div></section>
  <section class="related-features feature-shell"><div class="feature-section-heading"><p class="feature-kicker">Connected workflow</p><h2>The mockup is only the beginning.</h2></div><div class="related-grid pp-related-pair">
      <a href="/features/artwork-version-control"><small>Continue with</small><h3>Artwork Version Control</h3><p>Keep each revision attached to the same product and project.</p><span>Continue the workflow ↗</span></a>
      <a href="/features/customer-approval-portal"><small>Send it through</small><h3>Customer Approval Portal</h3><p>Share the finished mockup for focused feedback and a recorded decision.</p><span>Explore approval ↗</span></a>
    </div></section>
  <section class="feature-cta feature-shell" id="feature-contact">
    <div class="pp-cta-copy"><p class="feature-kicker">See it with your products</p><h2>Ready to create proofs without the long design handoff?</h2></div><a class="press-button" href="/contact">Talk to Sales <i>↗</i></a></section>
</section>
